  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13934290/assets/dc2f3fad9a09ed25fb9e6077069f63aac8afc09090f5453ece33c0b4ab5fb79f.png)\n\nA group of $10$ high school students is surveyed about their study habits. The scatter plot above shows the relationship between the amount of time they watch TV per week and their overall math scores. What is the overall math score of the student who watches TV for $10$ hours per week?",
